OL,3,GNEWSAI was told I was unworthy to be a
OL,4,Amother, then they stole my baby
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarion McMillan was 17, pregnant and
OL,7,Funmarried, when she made her first trip
OL,8,Fto England from her home in the
OL,9,Fsouth-west of Scotland.
OL,11,FIt was 1966 and she was sent by her
OL,12,Ffamily to a maternity home run by the
OL,13,FSalvation Army more than 150 miles
OL,14,Faway, in Newcastle upon Tyne.
OL,16,FThe young mum spent nine months with
OL,17,Fher baby - a beautiful boy with
OL,18,F"gorgeous wee black hair" - before he
OL,19,Fwas taken from her.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
