OL,3,GNEWSAI was told I was unworthy to be a
OL,4,Amother, then they stole my baby
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe begged staff to let her keep him.
OL,7,F"I said 'please help me keep my baby,
OL,8,Fdon't let them take my baby, please'
OL,9,Fand he was gone," she told a new BBC
OL,10,Fdocumentary, Stolen Babies.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
